1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,856
Who lives in the sea? Can you guess?

2
00:00:03,256 --> 00:00:05,133
It has eight long, wiggly arms!

3
00:00:08,933 --> 00:00:10,431
Yes! It's an octopus!

4
00:00:10,931 --> 00:00:12,714
Say it with me! Octopus!

5
00:00:16,014 --> 00:00:17,077
Who is this shadow?

6
00:00:17,477 --> 00:00:19,557
It walks sideways with two big claws!

7
00:00:23,357 --> 00:00:24,614
Yes! It's a crab!

8
00:00:25,114 --> 00:00:26,478
Say it with me! Crab!

9
00:00:29,778 --> 00:00:30,841
Who is this shadow?

10
00:00:31,241 --> 00:00:33,176
It jumps and splashes in the waves!

11
00:00:36,976 --> 00:00:38,401
Yes! It's a dolphin!

12
00:00:38,901 --> 00:00:40,488
Say it with me! Dolphin!

13
00:00:43,788 --> 00:00:45,539
Last one! Who is this shadow?

14
00:00:45,939 --> 00:00:48,306
It is super big and sprays water up high!

15
00:00:52,106 --> 00:00:53,355
Yes! It's a whale!

16
00:00:53,855 --> 00:00:55,187
Say it with me! Whale!

17
00:00:58,187 --> 00:01:00,682
Wow! You got them all! How many did you guess?

